@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title To add a publication genre (Process View Level 2)

participant ":UI\n[Frontend]" as UI
participant ":GenreRESTController\n[Backend]" as Backend
database "DB\n[Database]" as DB

== POST /genres ==

UI -> Backend : POST /genres?userId={userId}\n body: { genreName }
activate Backend

Backend -> DB : SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Backend : userData
deactivate DB

Backend -> DB : SELECT * FROM genres WHERE genre_type = ?
activate DB
DB --> Backend : result
deactivate DB

Backend -> DB : INSERT INTO genres ...
activate DB
DB --> Backend : savedData
deactivate DB

Backend --> UI : 201 Created\n body: GenreResponseDTO
deactivate Backend

@enduml